TOPIC_DESCRIPTION: Situation: You are at a job interview for a cook position in a restaurant kitchen. You have three years of restaurant experience, and this meeting decides whether your background fits the role and daily work.
Learner: Cook. Partner: Manager.
Not in this scene: salary, start date, documents, uniform, next steps after the interview.

About the learner, in their own words: Собеседование, я повар, работал в ресторане три года

